\", what, err, sentinel)\\n215-\\t}\\n216-}\\n217-\\n218-// mustParkedEntry fails unless summary is the per-session parked channel\\n219-// for the named session: Parked with the session directory name, a\\n220-// recoverable_parked_state blocking reason, and the expected retry hint.\\n221-// A listing that skips the parked session, returns it healthy, or fails\\n222-// the whole repository instead fails here.\\n223-func mustParkedEntry(t *testing.T, summary SessionSummary, sessionID, retryHint, what string) {\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2983,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 746,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
